## Interface: 16001
## Title: PersonalAddon
## Notes: Cherry-picked quality-of-life features, controller-first.
## Author: perceptum
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: PersonalAddonDB, PersonalAddonProbeLog
# PersonalAddonProbeLog held spike output. The spikes are gone, and the
# declaration stays for ONE version only so that Core/Registry.lua can empty the
# stale table on disk -- dropping the declaration outright would orphan whatever
# the probes last wrote, leaving it in the user's SavedVariables forever with
# nothing able to reach it. Remove this line and the wipe together next version.
